rows.prompt:
As a digital marketing professional exploring Medium for content marketing, please create a JSON object that summarizes the advantages of using Medium for brand content strategy. Ensure that the JSON includes at least five key benefits, each accompanied by a relevant quotation from a credible source. Additionally, analyze the letter frequency of each benefit description to ensure that the letter 'm' appears at least 3 times in each benefit's text. Use the following format:

```json
{
  "benefits": [
    {
      "benefit": "Title of Benefit 1",
      "description": "Description of benefit 1.",
      "quotation": "Relevant quotation for benefit 1."
    },
    {
      "benefit": "Title of Benefit 2",
      "description": "Description of benefit 2.",
      "quotation": "Relevant quotation for benefit 2."
    }
    // Add more benefits as needed
  ]
}
```

Remember to ensure that each description meets the letter frequency requirement.

